/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
77 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (Libraries are the most important part of any educational institution. They provide books, journals, and study material to students and teachers. But in most colleges, library work is still done manually using registers and paper records. This method is very slow, causes many mistakes, and students cannot check book availability from home.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
78 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (Our project Library and Digital Resource Management System \(LDRMS\) is a web-based application that solves all these problems. The frontend is built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The backend is developed using Node.js and Express.js. All data is stored in MongoDB database on cloud using MongoDB Atlas.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
