102 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 47 0 R
/E (After studying all these systems, we found that no existing system combines both physical book management and digital resources in one simple platform. Our project Library and Digital Resource Management System \(LDRMS\) fills this gap by providing a complete, beginner friendly, and easy to use web application using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, Express.js, and MongoDB.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
